<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Falcon,Falgold say talks go on.</title>
<headline>Falcon,Falgold say talks go on.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-07-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Zimbabwe's Falcon Gold Zimbabwe Ltd (Falgold) and its holding company Falcon Investments Ltd said talks were continuing with interested parties to develop on &quot;joint venture and other bases&quot; some properties under Falgold's control.</p>
<p>In a company notice published in Johannesburg, the firms urged their shareholders to be cautious in their dealings in their shares.</p>
<p>--Johannesburg newsroom -27-11-482.1003</p>
